<title>USA: Omnicare raises quarterly dividend 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Omnicare raises quarterly dividend 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare, Inc has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.0175 per share on its common stock, a 17 percent increase over the rate of $0.015 per share paid in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The indicated annual dividend rate for 1997 is $0.07 per share, 17 percent higher than the $0.06 per share paid in 1996.</p>
<p>The new dividend is payable March 7 to stockholders of record February 21.</p>
</text>
